SUMMARY:SAPA Stamp Bourse & Blue-Chip Auction Lot Viewing/Verification
DESCRIPTION:Monthly bourse featuring dealer tables and opportunities for buying\, selling\, and trading stamps and covers\, plus Blue-Chip Auction Lot Viewing and Lot Verification ahead of the December 11 SAPA Blue-Chip Auction. Lots submitted before November 20 are verified by a panel of SAPA experts. Visitors welcome! Doors open at 6:30 PM.
